  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Commonwealth Finance Ministers Meeting (CFMM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project convenes the Commonwealth Finance Ministers Meeting (CFMM), a platform for Ministers of Finance to deliberate on emerging economic issues which are of interest to the membership particularly small and vulnerable states. The deliberations are solution-based with the ultimate goal of advocating agreed positions at the global level.</narrative>
  </description>
